{
  "status": "success",
  "user_request": "Explain what reinforcement learning is.",
  "response": "Reinforcement learning (RL) is an area of machine learning and optimal control concerned with how an agent should act in a changing environment to maximize a reward signal. It is one of the three basic machine-learning paradigms, alongside supervised and unsupervised learning. Source: Wikipedia, [“Reinforcement learning”](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reinforcement_learning)."
}

